  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1641929ad758c3e8b9083c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同连结吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8383376008e49813ed0e63f72d4ea4e7119fbe1ed14941a5419a2d7e67601e8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:154f5bb96bbcd942955e35c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪我到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "956dbc965ec54cd13dacf14188d66c097f88e1204232e03b777fa387769a10f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6fd9e844d545c5d5a0f318",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来的路上，熟识的小猫\n给了我鼓励的话。\n它说『比赛要加油哦』…呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9cac190f9848466d92271ca137d9a199a12de5cd5ba485e8648f8dea27a708",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4240ae33c17d4119e7a0a6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体非常轻盈。\n与你共同积累的日子，如今仿佛\n化作了编织希望的羽翼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b747cd092c0e8add3632afbfa5ad4c5ef5945b5390c50993075cce1d6e389a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d20385e1340472fe02aae7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪我到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "956dbc965ec54cd13dacf14188d66c097f88e1204232e03b777fa387769a10f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f750aeb22d2932b0a49560b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43384d1b1b39ce9e4bd9f98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要跑出更多点亮希望的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60dad709f151e19050f47024c7ce25bd2ff1a36e38234c0a74d05d20569a72fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b0c9b07793b6920f5f813b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望之环，应该还能继续扩大…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a7e9c0698e569b57cff2c9613cfb5b2f333ada2dbf35fbb6ba664d0c970d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d3cb429060a576110b3f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须从这里，连结到下一次…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41091496d15570a6b76d866defa9923448faa9de6528c91b7a80635d6568c57d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a502d37e0d7b7782ff17eb9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时，光芒都一定存在…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec701934cc0293a2ffe9c9601ee61a6e9127cf3897530f33db474299411b812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6b9bc5c5791b0501dce26c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这次奔跑，能照亮某个人的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "435f1564143ef2cbe15d174cb990362eb5e8c644ced9aac9a3f51a69a0263f57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:669ff82627d9c7cc1caff54d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿希望——已经传达到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6ee1ab8ff4d52b157b8ca9b43fa3ec3b0977c6bd31b4e46a0f0bc0bb9dfab11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f346e3c2d60f7aff2f199e90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91819126087ccfa80daa4140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将希望的巨大『圆环』——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3bf03e7e9d9b64d784bc1ca18595aa270ed51b75b5d818601efdeea11bd8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310493ed6d9425925757d710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望无论何时，都在你的身边。\n来吧，让我们连结起来。将希望的巨大『圆环』——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f009f85e25909498c63ac3998417abd7f8cde4a02152fc5bc0c339891ef18fb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3f6b84a9b6320c80ca4b5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用歌声与舞蹈，连结希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "066f4e6f36f92df4c95d6e365060cc918d71c577526e845ce704c9ec6d4f76ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cca3b930cebc4fc6fd563f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在最棒的舞台上，让心合而为一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c739ab707c06f1a59332c33c35be443b7362364f7105795f1069c654dcd057e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe360edcea1b142b64f42e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以一个人独自硬撑哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e43c308286059fccfa5aa9e1cb23bcf82e108590f2703a0eb9409cf1ba6b6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7244727e0c59c079e9b1e37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那一天，我的心中点起了光。\n只要和你一起，就能将希望\n赠予更多人——那是让我如此相信的光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04aa0725a757f2d9093143cf4791e97b65e63e5c664561b86e217c78b76e6819",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c78ede2ef42b4588485f971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要陪伴在某人身旁，清爽整洁是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9127b4bc7beea3b86ce1a924d9399fd6ab5a1ad9867b3ce727b8c4ffff99279c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39dd43780435436688ad85f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着成对的衣服，感觉连心也连在一起了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e86b90ca3b5a3bd2f7f9127172e4d5cae7c062184600d8dc188881e51f38f10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c00e72131bb89a0a112bcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人孤身一人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5229286bc58648cc5f7d8508ca6e1d827d75b433f60b3add4222495c5cd7c0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7278792c3bbc3fa40448cdc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一节数学，会出什么样的题目呢…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b31344181cc833bb556c1c54b9cabc704f0008bd039a336203b4e450ac0c2e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f16726ddfb191c0d47e7b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎样的舞台，我都会让它扩展开来。一定会扩展出笑容之环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf5538795b3d2abb183693d905fd7e1b67d891c0f0578eb3e361492a9b2c9a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a1b8eda6a4763cd872349c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条缎带，像羽翼一样，很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "871b20fd902e369b950f2e3ff98021206151bf967d0d2e1a15b6fa9ab4c539d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5594c9ebf41b6c5ec016f545",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，穿起来真舒服…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6294c88f88c299aba896303edce33f449a166bbb44e7313deb0c1e62b63a03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ca870ab20a277f68d4f449",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着改变了，心情也会不同呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd80642689c9190857edcdb8d4f84d36a6b7a69b82cdc0dc02a6f0c507724127",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba388a7fff5af3ea75ec0d16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去哪里出门呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "49aea722f60057ce0e23f04f3e1988eb0edc1a25efae7a9cb8427095701923d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0da33e3f2a4e0c5a66c93c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这枚胸针，是父亲送给我的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d11d6570b702be2e27ae25ad2ad2a9367f2f0f903ffe5a0ddb2f0fa135b964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70e2f3cd3ff1d26be2c8bc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要陪伴在某人身旁，清爽整洁是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9127b4bc7beea3b86ce1a924d9399fd6ab5a1ad9867b3ce727b8c4ffff99279c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f447f28eb7a3eca285ddc67f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着成对的衣服，感觉连心也连在一起了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e86b90ca3b5a3bd2f7f9127172e4d5cae7c062184600d8dc188881e51f38f10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e196a3502c7715851e27ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人孤身一人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5229286bc58648cc5f7d8508ca6e1d827d75b433f60b3add4222495c5cd7c0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40dbb89ebb5f66ff292579ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一节数学，会出什么样的题目呢…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b31344181cc833bb556c1c54b9cabc704f0008bd039a336203b4e450ac0c2e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1fe1252956f68174665656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎样的舞台，我都会让它扩展开来。一定会扩展出笑容之环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf5538795b3d2abb183693d905fd7e1b67d891c0f0578eb3e361492a9b2c9a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
